a) Agenda and minutes of the previous meetings;
b) Relevant draft standards/amendments;
c) Relevant IS (with latest amendments) including all reference standards;
d) Reference books/ literature/ materials;
e) Programme of work of the department;
f) Form for claiming TA/DA by members; and
g) Form for recording attendance of the members.
NOTE – Member Secretary may utilize this occasion to obtain up-do-date information on mailing
address, telephone number, email ids etc so that BIS data base on technical committee membership is
updated if need be.

